{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 3, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "必", "id": "必"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "楚", "id": "楚"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "秦", "id": "秦"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "說", "id": "說"}, {"form": "迎", "id": "迎"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.9132560517297525, "source": "迎", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.065958191342549, "source": "迎", "target": "必"}, {"weight": 3.3187211598379167, "source": "心", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 3.4522525524624394, "source": "心", "target": "必"}, {"weight": 3.7887247890836524, "source": "心", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 1.25502797512622, "source": "必", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.065958191342549, "source": "必", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.6604930832343845, "source": "必", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 1.8428146400283392, "source": "必", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 1.3728110107826037, "source": "必", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 1.8428146400283392, "source": "必", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 1.239279618158081, "source": "先", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 2.9822489232167038, "source": "先", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 0.8338145100499167, "source": "先", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.402430427963762, "source": "先", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 2.065958191342549, "source": "先", "target": "楚"}, {"weight": 1.526961690609862, "source": "先", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.065958191342549, "source": "先", "target": "秦"}, {"weight": 2.220108871169807, "source": "先", "target": "說"}, {"wei